SUMMARY:Trivia Bowl (3 week tournament)
DESCRIPTION:It’s that time of year again\, Trivia Bowl! \nGather your team and put your general knowledge to the test in a three-week trivia showdown. Compete head-to-head each week for the chance to claim the Trivia Bowl title. \nThe winning team earns ultimate bragging rights and the opportunity to brew a custom beer to enjoy while celebrating their victory in front of the competition. Don’t miss your chance to prove you’re the smartest team in the room!
URL:https://www.eurekaheights.com/event/trivia-bowl-3-week-tournament/
LOCATION:Tap Room\, 941 W 18TH ST.\, Houston\, TX\, 77008\, United States
CATEGORIES:Tap Room
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.eurekaheights.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08-05-26.png
END:VEVENT
