SUMMARY:Animal Justice League Pet Adoptions
DESCRIPTION:Come have a beer and find a best friend. Join our friends at Animal Justice League as they set up at the brewery with the hopes of finding you a new best friend. Come meet\, foster\, or just keep a puppy company. Donations are welcome to ensuring that we get Houston cats and dogs the care they need.
URL:https://www.eurekaheights.com/event/animal-justice-league-pet-adoptions/
