SUMMARY:10th Anniversary Party
DESCRIPTION:We’re turning 10\, and we’re celebrating ALL WEEK LONG! \nJoin us as we kick off our 10-Year Birthday Bash with a full week of events: \nTuesday: Special High Five Members Night\nWednesday: Eureka Heights-themed Trivia\nThursday: Celebrate 10 Years of Laces Out Run Club\nFriday: Eureka Heights Garage Sale\nSaturday: Our 10-Year Birthday Bash!\nVIP Entry: 10 AM–12 PM\nOG beer pours\nLive music from CC Rider Band\nIce House Radio DJ\nLive screen printing by GooseWorks\nFirkin tappings\nAnd a whole lot more! \nSunday: Eureka & Chill with a special Discs & Donuts post-Eureka Heights party. \nCome raise a glass\, celebrate a decade of great beer\, and make some new memories with us. We can’t wait to celebrate with you! \nLink for VIP party
URL:https://www.eurekaheights.com/event/10th-anniversary-party/
LOCATION:Tap Room\, 941 W 18TH ST.\, Houston\, TX\, 77008\, United States
CATEGORIES:Tap Room
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.eurekaheights.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/event-2026-08-22.png
END:VEVENT
